<p class="hero-marker">Step two · Turn the theme into a form</p>
<p class="body">The most direct way to build a form from a tune is with a common form called <strong>theme and variations.</strong> <span>The theme is immediately stated</span> so that its identity is fixed; what follows is a series of changes in rhythm, texture, mode, and ornament that modify the theme while maintaining a connection to its original shape.</p>

<div class="realmusic">
<div class="realmusic-head"><span class="rm-tag">Listening study</span><span class="rm-work">One theme · four variations</span></div>
<p class="rm-intro">The ghosted <em>shared path</em> beneath each panel is the theme's four-bar shape you just learned; the brighter surface above it is what each variation changes.</p>
<div class="viz-embed">
  <div id="form-theme-variations-basic-motion">
    <style is:global>
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .clip-title { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; align-items:baseline; margin:0 0 .5rem; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .clip-title strong { font-weight:500; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .clip-title span, #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .status { color:var(--muted-foreground); }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .stage { display:block; width:100%; margin:.55rem 0 0; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion text { fill:var(--foreground); font-family:inherit; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .muted { fill:var(--muted-foreground); }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .guide { stroke:var(--border); stroke-width:1.25; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .section { fill:var(--muted); stroke:var(--border); stroke-width:1; opacity:.52; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .section.active { fill:var(--accent); stroke:var(--primary); stroke-width:2.5; opacity:1; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .memory { fill:none; stroke:var(--viz-series-1,var(--primary)); stroke-width:3.6; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; opacity:.46; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .surface { fill:none; stroke:var(--viz-series-2,var(--primary)); stroke-width:2.2; opacity:.62; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .surface-dot { fill:var(--viz-series-3,var(--primary)); opacity:.7; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .support { fill:none; stroke:var(--viz-series-4,var(--primary)); stroke-width:2; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; opacity:.36; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .active-mark { stroke:var(--foreground); opacity:1; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .surface-dot.active-mark { fill:var(--foreground); }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .now { stroke:var(--foreground); stroke-width:2.5; }
    #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .status { margin:.25rem 0 0; }
    @media (max-width:620px) { #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .clip-title { display:block; } #form-theme-variations-basic-motion .stage text { font-size:20px; } }
    </style>
    <p class="clip-title"><strong>Theme and variations</strong><span>same four-bar path · new surface each time</span></p>
    <p class="sr-only">The shared four-bar theme is followed by four variations. Rhythm, texture, mode, and ornament change in turn while the same phrase map and a quieter harmonic-support lane remain visible beneath every version.</p>
    <audio controls preload="metadata"><source src="/guides/listening-studio/musical-forms/audio/question-answer-return--theme-and-variations--web-final-01.m4a" type="audio/mp4"></audio>
    <svg class="stage" viewBox="0 0 760 440" role="img" aria-labelledby="variations-title variations-desc">
      <title id="variations-title">One theme retaining its form through four variations</title>
      <desc id="variations-desc">Five equal sections repeat the same ghosted phrase contour while different visual surfaces represent rhythmic, textural, modal, and ornamental change. A quieter lower lane shows the recurring harmonic framework supporting all five versions.</desc>
      <text class="muted" x="18" y="92">surface</text><text class="muted" x="18" y="223">shared path</text>
      <text class="muted" x="18" y="307">harmonic</text><text class="muted" x="18" y="327">support</text>
      <line class="guide" x1="112" y1="316" x2="732" y2="316"></line>
      <g class="sections"></g><g class="marks"></g><g class="supports"></g>
      <line class="now" x1="112" y1="50" x2="112" y2="377"></line>
    </svg>
    <p class="status" aria-hidden="true">The theme establishes the four-bar phrase path.</p>
    <p class="sr-only" data-listening-live aria-live="polite">The theme establishes the four-bar phrase path.</p>
    <script is:inline>
      (()=>{
        const root=document.getElementById('form-theme-variations-basic-motion'),audio=root.querySelector('audio'),svg=root.querySelector('svg'),ns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';
        const x0=112,width=620,end=46.154,cell=width/5;
        const sections=[['theme','original'],['variation 1','rhythm'],['variation 2','texture'],['variation 3','major mode'],['variation 4','ornament']];
        const contour=[24,12,6,18,31,25,34,21,8,15,29,36];
        const make=(name,attrs={})=>{const node=document.createElementNS(ns,name);Object.entries(attrs).forEach(([key,value])=>node.setAttribute(key,value));return node;};
        sections.forEach((section,index)=>{
          const x=x0+index*cell;
          svg.querySelector('.sections').appendChild(make('rect',{class:'section','data-index':index,x:x.toFixed(2),y:'58',width:(cell-3).toFixed(2),height:'312',rx:'6'}));
          const label=make('text',{x:(x+cell/2).toFixed(2),y:'405','text-anchor':'middle'});label.textContent=section[0];svg.querySelector('.sections').appendChild(label);
          const note=make('text',{class:'muted',x:(x+cell/2).toFixed(2),y:'429','text-anchor':'middle'});note.textContent=section[1];svg.querySelector('.sections').appendChild(note);
          const points=contour.map((value,point)=>`${(x+8+point*(cell-16)/(contour.length-1)).toFixed(2)},${(200+value/2).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');
          svg.querySelector('.marks').appendChild(make('polyline',{class:'memory','data-mark':index,points}));
