<div class="fn-group">Subjectivity as structure</div>
<div class="related-wrap">
<details class="related">
<summary><span class="rf-fn">Fantasy · episodic</span><span class="rf-name">Free fantasy</span></summary>
<div class="rf-body">
<p><strong>What it is.</strong> The fantasy cultivates an improvisatory, episodic, or unpredictable succession of ideas rather than one conventional public scheme.</p>
<p><strong>Why it matters.</strong> It gives compositional form to subjectivity itself — interruption, recollection, and sudden contrast become the logic of the work. <strong>Hear it as the second reading in the hero player above:</strong> follow returns of gesture or mood instead of a textbook section order.</p>
</div>
