<div class="cue"><div class="cue-lbl">Listen for</div><p>In the mosaic: the cut between blocks, and which blocks return. In the blues: the three four-bar spans, and how the repeated line sets up its answer.</p></div>

<p class="section-label">Related form · grouped by function</p>
<div class="fn-group">A systematic order without a tonic</div>
